# Cite this software repository; preferred-citation is the foundational paper.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its ATG-based design, please cite the Atomic Task
  Graph paper (preferred-citation) and, when citing the software itself, this
  repository entry.
type: software
title: atg-framework
abstract: >-
  Prototype implementation of Atomic Task Graph (ATG) concepts for robust,
  efficient LLM-based agents. Independent open-source work inspired by the
  research paper; not an official release from the paper authors.
license: TBD
